# Infrastructure

- Stacks are `findingalpha` and `findingalpha-admin-web`. The bootstrap qualifier comes from `CDK_BOOTSTRAP_QUALIFIER`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- The HTTP API uses `SharedPermissionLambdaIntegration` plus one `AdminApiInvoke` permission. Do not switch back to `HttpLambdaIntegration` per route or add `events.Rule` targets on `AdminApiFn`. New schedules use EventBridge Scheduler with an IAM-role target. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- SES send grants are `Resource: *` plus `ses:FromAddress` (`sesSendFromDomainStatement`). Identity-ARN resource lists pass tests and deny in production. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Secret parameters set `noEcho: true`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Python bundling targets arm64. Use QEMU on x86-64 (`docker/setup-qemu-action`) or `CDK_SKIP_PYTHON_PIP=1` for a template-only synth. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
